三季財報電話會議紀錄"},{"title":"What O'Reilly Automotive Stock Earnings Beat Means For Shareholders","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"O'Reilly Automotive 股票收益上漲對股東意味著什麼"},{"title":"O'Reilly Automotive's Strong Q3 Results Masked Weaker Details, UBS Says","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNbUwzeTliQlMyQVZnbGd1cU1TM3NCMks1VGhQekk2eGFqdERJb0RpM1poQ19janpYYVN5ZEl3bHdQQmlyclBTNkpabjc4Tmc4WFE1cHhMakd1LXk4Q3RpT0NBWjU3VnZlTXZ1cm1Rb2ZCYks0Q0RMQjZEVGlGQTQ3SmFYS1VBWFVWNDdWai1UTy1Gcy1DaXJPYWt3?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"瑞銀表示，O'Reilly Automotive 強勁的第三季業績掩蓋了較弱的細節"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"關稅/貿易","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-27","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/898173/000089817326000009/orly-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Unless otherwise indicated, \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" and similar terms, as well as references to the \"Company,\" refer to O'Reilly Automotive, Inc. and its Subsidiaries. O'Reilly is one of the largest specialty retailers of automotive aftermarket parts, tools, supplies, equipment, and accessories across North America, selling our products to both do-it-yourself (\"DIY\") and professional service provider customers, our \"dual market strategy.\" The business was founded in 1957 by Charles F. O'Reilly and his son, Charles H. \"Chub'' O'Reilly, Sr., and initially operated from a single store in Springfield, Missouri. Our common stock has traded on The Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol \"ORLY\" since April 22, 1993.","zh":"除非另有說明，否則「我們」、「我們的」和類似術語以及提及的「本公司」均指 O'Reilly Automotive, Inc. 及其子公司。 O'Reilly 是北美最大的汽車售後零件、工具、用品、設備和配件專業零售商之一，向 DIY (“DIY”) 和專業服務提供商客戶銷售我們的產品，這是我們的「雙市場策略」。該公司由 Charles F. O'Reilly 和他的兒子 Charles H. \"Chub'' O'Reilly, Sr. 於 1957 年創立，最初在密蘇裡州斯普林菲爾德的一家商店運營。我們的普通股自 1993 年 4 月 22 日起在納斯達克全球精選市場交易，代碼為“ORLY”。"},{"en":"On June 10, 2025, the Company completed a 15-for-1 forward stock split of our common stock. All share and per share information, including share-based compensation, in the current and comparable periods throughout this annual report on Form 10-K, has been retrospectively adjusted to reflect the stock split. All shares of common stock retained a par value of $0.01 per share.","zh":"2025 年 6 月 10 日，公司完成了普通股 15 比 1 的遠期股票分割。 10-K 表格年度報告中當前和可比較期間的所有股份和每股資訊（包括基於股份的薪酬）均已進行追溯調整，以反映股票分割情況。所有普通股的面額均保留為每股 0.01 美元。"},{"en":"At December 31, 2025, we operated 6,447 stores in 48 states in the United States (\"U.S.\") and Puerto Rico, 112 stores in Mexico, and 26 stores in Canada. Our stores carry an extensive product line, including:","zh":"截至2025年12月31日，我們在美國48個州和波多黎各經營6,447家商店，在墨西哥經營112家商店，在加拿大經營26家商店。我們的商店擁有廣泛的產品線，包括："}],"markets":[{"en":"Our stores offer DIY and professional service provider customers a wide selection of products for domestic and imported automobiles, vans, and trucks. Our merchandise generally consists of nationally recognized, well-advertised, premium name brand products, such as AC Delco, Armor All, Bosch, Castrol, Denso, Dorman, Fel-Pro, Gates Rubber, Lucas Oil, Mobil1, Monroe, NGK, Pennzoil, Prestone, Standard, STP, Turtle Wax, Valvoline, and Wix, and a wide selection of quality proprietary private label products, which span the entire good, better, and best value spectrum, under our BesTest , BrakeBest , Cartek , Import Direct , MasterPro , MicroGard , Murray , Omnispark , O'Reilly Auto Parts , Precision , Power-Torque , Super-Start , Syntec , and Ultima brands. Our proprietary private label products are produced by respected automotive manufacturers, meet or exceed original equipment manufacturer ","zh":"我們的商店為 DIY 和專業服務提供者客戶提供多種國產和進口汽車、貨車和卡車產品選擇。我們的商品通常包括全國公認的、廣為人知的優質名牌產品，如 AC Delco、Armor All、Bosch、Castrol、Denso、Dorman、Fel-Pro、Gates Rubber、Lucas Oil、Mobil1、Monroe、NGK、Pennzoil、Prestone、Standard、STP、Tobil1、Monroe、NGK、Pennzoil、Prestone、Standard、STP、Tobil1、Monroe、NGK、Pennzoil、Prestone、Standard、STP、Tobil1、Monroe、NGK、Pennzoil、Prestone、Standard、STP、Turtle Wax、Valvoline 和 Wix，以及我們整個品牌的最佳價值，以及所有優質產品BesTest 、 BrakeBest 、 Cartek 、 Import Direct 、 MasterPro 、 MicroGard 、 Murray 、 Omnispark 、 O'Reilly Auto Parts 、 Precision 、 Power-Torque 、 Super-Start 、 Syntec 和 Ultima 品牌下。我們專有的自有品牌產品由受人尊敬的汽車製造商生產，達到或超過原始設備製造商的水平"},{"en":"We have no long-term contracts with material purchase commitments with any of our suppliers, nor have we experienced difficulty in obtaining satisfactory alternative supply sources for automotive parts. We believe that alternative supply sources exist at competitive costs for substantially all of the automotive products that we sell. It is our policy to take advantage of payment and seasonal purchasing discounts offered by our suppliers and to utilize extended dating terms available from suppliers. We have entered into various programs and arrangements with certain suppliers that provided for extended dating and payment terms for inventory purchases. As a whole, we consider our relationships with our suppliers to be very good.","zh":"我們與任何供應商並無簽訂有材料採購承諾的長期合同，我們在獲得令人滿意的汽車零件替代供應來源方面也沒有遇到困難。我們相信，對於我們銷售的幾乎所有汽車產品來說，都存在著成本具有競爭力的替代供應來源。我們的政策是利用供應商提供的付款和季節性採購折扣，並利用供應商提供的延長約會條款。我們已與某些供應商簽訂了各種計劃和安排，為庫存採購提供了延長的日期和付款條件。總的來說，我們認為我們與供應商的關係非常好。"}],"customers":[{"en":"In 2025, we derived approximately 50% of our sales from our DIY customers and approximately 50% of our sales from our professional service provider customers. Historically, we have increased our sales to professional service provider customers at a faster pace than the increase in our sales to DIY customers due to the more fragmented nature of the professional service provider business, which offers a greater opportunity for consolidation. We believe we will continue to have a competitive advantage on the professional service provider portion of our business, due to our systems, knowledge, industry-leading parts availability, and experience serving the professional service provider side of the automotive aftermarket, augmented by our approximately 825 full-time sales staff dedicated solely to calling upon and servicing the professional service provider customer. We will also continue to ","zh":"到 2025 年，我們約 50% 的銷售額來自 DIY 客戶，約 50% 的銷售額來自專業服務提供者客戶。從歷史上看，由於專業服務提供者業務更加分散，我們對專業服務提供者客戶的銷售額成長速度快於對 DIY 客戶的銷售額成長速度，這提供了更大的整合機會。我們相信，由於我們的系統、知識、行業領先的零件可用性以及為汽車售後市場的專業服務提供者提供服務的經驗，再加上我們大約 825 名專門致力於拜訪和服務專業服務提供商客戶的全職銷售人員，我們將繼續在我們業務的專業服務提供者部分保持競爭優勢。我們也將繼續"}],"competition":[{"en":"The sale of automotive aftermarket items is highly competitive in many areas, including customer service, product availability, store location, brand recognition, and price. We compete in both the DIY and professional service provider portions of the automotive aftermarket and are one of the largest specialty retailers within that market. We compete primarily with:","zh":"汽車售後市場產品的銷售在許多方面都具有高度競爭性，包括客戶服務、產品可用性、商店位置、品牌知名度和價格。我們在汽車售後市場的 DIY 和專業服務提供者領域競爭，並且是該市場中最大的專業零售商之一。我們主要與以下競爭對手競爭："},{"en":"Wholesalers or jobber stores (some of which are associated with national automotive parts distributors or associations such as NAPA, CARQUEST, Bumper to Bumper, and Auto Value).","zh":"批發商或批發商店（其中一些與國家汽車零件分銷商或協會相關，例如 NAPA、CARQUEST、Bumper to Bumper 和 Auto Value）。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["AZO","AAP","ROST","TSCO","FAST"]}}